"(eno na vrstico). Primeri:<br>.no-lightbox<br>.custom-gallery "
"img<br>#sidebar .widget-area"

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3729
#: dist/ml-slider-lightbox/class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3541
#: dist/ml-slider-lightbox/ml-slider-lightbox/class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3541
#: ml-slider-lightbox/class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3729
msgid "Minimum Image Width"
msgstr "Minimalna širina slike"

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3732
#: ml-slider-lightbox/class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3732
msgid ""
"Skip images narrower than this width (in pixels). Uses the displayed width, "
"not the actual image file size. This is helpful for excluding small icons, "
"badges, and buttons."
msgstr ""
"Preskočite slike, ki so ožje od te širine (v pikslih). Uporablja prikazano "
"širino, ne dejanske velikosti datoteke slike. To je koristno za izključitev "
"majhnih ikon, značk in gumbov."

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3755
