#: dist/ml-slider-lightbox/ml-slider-lightbox/class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3544
msgid ""
"Skip images narrower than this width (in pixels). Useful to exclude small "
"icons, badges, and buttons. Set to 0 to disable width checking."
msgstr ""
"Preskočite slike, ožje od te širine (v slikovnih pikah). Koristno za "
"izključitev majhnih ikon, značk in gumbov. Nastavite na 0, da onemogočite "
"preverjanje širine."

