msgstr "Pager paginacija je na voljo v MetaSlider Lightbox Pro"

#: dist/ml-slider-lightbox/class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3868
#: dist/ml-slider-lightbox/ml-slider-lightbox/class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3868
